{"steam_appid":1609370,"steam_name":"Caravanners ","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1609370/1386566216/dedf09c80a7596bc0c89549ec101ef833931b33d/1754783367/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754789716","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257180944/e257ac1bcb98c1873820089ab0b34ffd8d434680/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754789716","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/04445f068dc840b0963406aa97583d46dfe98fc4/ss_04445f068dc840b0963406aa97583d46dfe98fc4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787767221","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/d19fb759324e035e2d6affa92f11c1a24ddad240/ss_d19fb759324e035e2d6affa92f11c1a24ddad240.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787767221","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/c181e6bab3f8326397d2a42349ee9726b06e7e10/ss_c181e6bab3f8326397d2a42349ee9726b06e7e10.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787767221","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/d546edd75a0af08e5a55bbbdfc9f359101832fff/ss_d546edd75a0af08e5a55bbbdfc9f359101832fff.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787767221","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/b1a507708cdad5d3a8d282b04f195f189c521c68/ss_b1a507708cdad5d3a8d282b04f195f189c521c68.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787767221"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/de674bcc013139eb6be3455731642d2c.avif?t=1787767221\" width=1560 height=230 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong>discord. gg  /26RXt8EctG </strong><br> <br><strong>EARLY ACCESS - ALPHA</strong> <br> <br><strong>Caravanners</strong> is a chill exploration and life adventure centered around caravans and camping, set in a massive open world. Start from scratch with a small truck, buy an empty caravan, and design your dream camper. Explore nature by day, enjoy music by the campfire with friends at night. 🎵🔥</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/574a90e992b6a6e04bca501357d69e00.avif?t=1787767221\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔓 Massive open world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏕️ Diverse regions and biomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌄 Dynamic weather system – Rain, fog, sun, snow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 Play solo or co-op with 1–4 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Do various jobs and earn money</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ Detailed caravan interior and exterior customization – Create your own style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌔 Day-night cycle – Different vibes for day and night</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏕️ Caravan camping life – The world is your home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚌 Travel in convoy with your friends using multiple caravans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 A sustainable adventure awaits in a huge world without boredom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A MASSIVE OPEN WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big world ready to explore with swimmable lakes and seas, forests, islands, villages, towns, mountains, hidden places, and diverse regions! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/b92c9827b0699b3b648f979eddc8faf2.avif?t=1787767221\" width=1000 height=784 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/68df98e6b65c16bb455dcc28036968c0.poster.avif?t=1787767221\" width=700 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/68df98e6b65c16bb455dcc28036968c0.webm?t=1787767221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/68df98e6b65c16bb455dcc28036968c0.mp4?t=1787767221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR CARAVAN IS YOUR HOME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍲 Store your food in the fridge  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍳 Cook meals and feed yourself  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛋️ Sit on the couch, enjoy the view, play music  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪟 Open or close the curtains – set your mood  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 Turn the lights on or off  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚽 Use the toilet in your caravan  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛺️ Set up your campsite with awnings around your caravan  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/778ae2498a1e611e1f0d15110215239a.poster.avif?t=1787767221\" width=700 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/778ae2498a1e611e1f0d15110215239a.webm?t=1787767221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/778ae2498a1e611e1f0d15110215239a.mp4?t=1787767221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESIGN AND BUILD YOUR OWN CAMPSITE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the campsite of your dreams from scratch, alone or with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your ideal camping spot with fully modular parts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌄 Whether by a lake or deep in the woods anywhere can be your campsite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪑 Set up your table and chairs,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Light your campfire,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 Play your music,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥩 Grill your meat,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧘 Chill with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True freedom awaits at your custom designed campsite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you live and what you do is entirely up to you! 🌲💫</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/069f71fcc08144652a332b2d7a08d022.poster.avif?t=1787767221\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/069f71fcc08144652a332b2d7a08d022.webm?t=1787767221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/069f71fcc08144652a332b2d7a08d022.mp4?t=1787767221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESOURCE MANAGEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, thirst, sleep, toilet, fuel, food, money, reputation points – manage both personal and general resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION – DESIGN YOUR DREAM CARAVAN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/b42e0e2c49a52ca14fbd27accb383c6a.avif?t=1787767221\" width=600 height=194 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/b8c7ac95c357e0ba4821cf25f2b8ca6c.poster.avif?t=1787767221\" width=700 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/b8c7ac95c357e0ba4821cf25f2b8ca6c.webm?t=1787767221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/b8c7ac95c357e0ba4821cf25f2b8ca6c.mp4?t=1787767221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTERIOR CUSTOMIZATION – TUNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint choices for body, wheels, and bumpers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle skins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change bumpers, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change wheels,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your accessories,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/bb67d2d8500e57275a066d11c94f3459.poster.avif?t=1787767221\" width=700 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/bb67d2d8500e57275a066d11c94f3459.webm?t=1787767221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609370/extras/bb67d2d8500e57275a066d11c94f3459.mp4?t=1787767221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FURNITURE CUSTOMIZATION</strong> – <strong>DESIGN YOUR LIVING SPACE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also customize the interior walls, floor, and ceiling of your caravan. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from wood, solid colors, or fabrics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seat selection </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cabin selection </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decor selection </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curtain and fabric selection </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fridge, grill, sink, toilet... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✅<strong>DON’T FORGET TO ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST!✅</strong></h2>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 18 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvdia 2080 - 3060 <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 18 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie","Simulation","Free To Play","Early Access"],"developers":["Akif Akdemir"],"publishers":["PLEXUS GAME"],"release_date":"Oct 31, 2025"}